<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47052" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sur-rēmĭgo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subr-</span></b> ), āre,
			v. n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to row underneath</i>, <i>to row
			along</i> (very rare). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">laeva tacitis surremigat undis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 10, 227</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bracchiis surremigans,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					9, 29, 47, § 88</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">surremigante seu potius velificante
					nequitiā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Calp. Fl. Decl. 20</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
